.TH HYPR-DE-HELP 1 "2026-08-15" "hypr-DE" "hypr-DE"
.SH NAME
hypr-de-help \- welcome and help window for hypr-DE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hypr-de-help
.RI [ --welcome ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the hypr-DE help window: a Welcome page, a How it works explanation
of the session, and a live keybind list loaded from
.B hyprctl binds -j .
.PP
.B SUPER+/
is bound to this command.
.B SUPER+SHIFT+/
opens the fuzzel cheatsheet of the same binds.
.PP
.B --welcome
selects the Welcome page. First login runs
.B hypr-de-welcome ,
which is marker-gated and then execs
.B hypr-de-help --welcome .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --welcome
Show the first-run Welcome page instead of Keybinds.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hypr-de (7),
.BR workspace-zones (7)
